cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this software, please cite it as below, together with the original
  Fortran SPO-DVR code it was ported from (M. F. Somers' thesis and the Kroes–Somers paper
  under references).
type: software
title: "Cpp-SPO-DVR"
abstract: >-
  A modern C++20 rewrite of the Fortran SPO-DVR code: six-dimensional time-dependent
  quantum wave-packet dynamics of a diatomic molecule scattering from a surface
  (coordinates Z, r, x, y, θ, φ), with split-operator propagation, FFT grids in Z, r, x
  and y, and a Gauss–Legendre/FFT DVR in θ and φ. CPU (OpenMP) and optional NVIDIA GPU
  (CUDA) backend.
authors:
  - family-names: Smeets
    given-names: Egidius W. F.
repository-code: "https://github.com/ewfsmeets/Cpp-SPO-DVR"
date-released: 2026-11-19
license: GPL-3.0-or-later
keywords:
  - quantum dynamics
  - wave packet
  - split-operator method
  - molecule-surface scattering
  - dissociative chemisorption
  - CUDA
